# Build context is services/billing/worker (docker build -f Dockerfile.ingest .): send only the code the worker runs.
# Everything else (datasets/, out/, .agent_cache/, notes) stays out of the image and out of the build context.
*
!requirements-ingest.txt
!run_account.sh
!scripts/
!cur/
!worker/
!Dockerfile.ingest
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# Dockerfile.ingest is re-included above: CDK stages the context with these rules, then builds with --file Dockerfile.ingest from the staged copy.
